ain](http://blog.csdn.net/shulianghan/article/details/18964835#)[copy](http://blog.csdn.net/shulianghan/article/details/18964835#)[![在CODE上查看代码片](https://code.csdn.net/assets/CODE_ico.png)](https://code.csdn.net/snippets/181707)[![派生到我的代码片](https://code.csdn.net/assets/ico_fork.svg)](https://code.csdn.net/snippets/181707/fork) &lt;div&gt; &lt;embed id=&quot;ZeroClipboardMovie_34&quot; src=&quot;http://static.blog.csdn.net/scripts/ZeroClipboard/ZeroClipboard.swf&quot; type=&quot;application/x-shockwave-flash&quot; width=&quot;18&quot; height=&quot;18&quot; align=&quot;middle&quot; name=&quot;ZeroClipboardMovie_34&quot;&gt; &lt;/embed&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; - &lt;span class=&quot;keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (alen &gt; 0) { - rtn = (&lt;span class=&quot;datatypes&quot;&gt;char&lt;/span&gt;*) malloc(alen + 1); &lt;span class=&quot;comment&quot;&gt;//new char[alen+1]; &amp;#8220;\0&amp;#8221;&lt;/span&gt; - memcpy(rtn, ba, alen); - rtn[alen] = 0; - } &lt;/div&gt; g.**释放内存** :&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;dp-highlighter bg_cpp&quot;&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;tools&quot;&gt; **[cpp]** [view plain](http://blog.csdn.net/shulianghan/article/details/18964835#)[copy](http://blog.csdn.net/shulianghan/article/details/18964835#)[![在CODE上查看代码片](https://code.csdn.net/assets/CODE_ico.png)](https://code.csdn.net/snippets/181707)[![派生到我的代码片](https://code.csdn.net/assets/ico_fork.svg)](https://code.csdn.net/snippets/181707/fork) &lt;div&gt; &lt;embed id=&quot;ZeroClipboardMovie_35&quot; src=&quot;http://static.blog.csdn.net/scripts/ZeroClipboard/ZeroClipboard.swf&quot; type=&quot;application/x-shockwave-flash&quot; width=&quot;18&quot; height=&quot;18&quot; align=&quot;middle&quot; name=&quot;ZeroClipboardMovie_35&quot;&gt; &lt;/embed&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; - (*env)-&gt;ReleaseByteArrayElements(env, barr, ba, 0); &lt;span class=&quot;comment&quot;&gt;//释放内存&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; 